What was taken
--------------

    include/            public engine headers
    src/                engine sources, including the CUDA/HIP device code
    cmake/              backend helper scripts the top-level CMake includes
    third_party/ggml/   ggml shared headers and VERSION.txt (pins llama.cpp commit
