iGPU Expert Pool Shaders (ADR-020)
-----------------------------------

The Vulkan compute shaders for the Strata iGPU expert pool (`strata_q2_0_gemv.comp`,
`strata_swiglu_quant.comp`) are original works developed for this project. They implement
Q2_0 matrix-vector multiplication and fused SwiGLU+quantization for Intel iGPU hardware
using the Vulkan 1.0 compute API.

These shaders are compiled offline with glslangValidator and embedded as byte arrays
in `spv_data.hpp`. The Vulkan runtime is loaded via dlopen at runtime, requiring no
link-time dependency on libvulkan (ADR-008, ADR-020).
